        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants and clinical outcomes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 0;\n    background: #f4f7ff;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Nunito\", Verdana, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f7f9ff;\n    padding: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    background: #0d2f7a;\n    margin: 0 45px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    min-height: 280px;\n  }\n  .header-text { padding: 55px 30px 30px 50px; flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .header h1 {\n    color: #7ec8f2;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n    max-width: 700px;\n  }\n  .authors {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .affil {\n    color: #d8e4f7;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .header-img {\n    width: 330px;\n    flex: 0 0 330px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #e8eefb;\n    border: 1px dashed #9bb4de;\n    color: #4a628f;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px;\n  }\n  .hands-ph { width: 300px; height: 250px; background: #10357f; border-color: #4f7ac4; color: #bcd3f5; }\n\n  .rule-thick {\n    height: 7px;\n    background: #3d92e8;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 28px 45px 30px 45px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Body columns ---------- */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 42px;\n    padding: 0 45px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col-left  { flex: 0 0 330px; }\n  .col-mid   { flex: 0 0 375px; }\n  .col-right { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n\n  h2.section {\n    color: #0d2f7a;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  h2.section.small { font-size: 22px; }\n  .underline {\n    height: 3px;\n    background: #6fb2e8;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.62;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n  }\n  .step-num {\n    width: 26px; height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #cfe6fa;\n    color: #0d2f7a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 22px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .step-text {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Table ---------- */\n  table.results {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    background: #fbfcff;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  table.results thead td {\n    background: #0d2f7a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 16px 8px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.results tbody td {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 14px 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6ebf5;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  table.results tbody td:first-child { color: #333; }\n  table.results tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n\n  /* ---------- Right column charts ---------- */\n  .chart-title {\n    color: #0d2f7a;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .donut-ph { width: 170px; height: 170px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 22px auto; }\n  .legend { font-size: 11.5px; margin: 0 0 34px 18px; }\n  .legend div { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .swatch { width: 11px; height: 11px; margin-right: 10px; flex: 0 0 11px; }\n  .s1 { background: #3d92e8; }\n  .s2 { background: #7fd0f7; }\n  .s3 { background: #dbe6fb; }\n  .legend .lbl { flex: 1 1 auto; color: #333; }\n  .legend .val { color: #333; padding-left: 12px; }\n\n  .photo-ph  { width: 100%; height: 470px; }\n  .syringe-ph { width: 100%; height: 430px; margin-top: 24px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .rule-bottom {\n    height: 7px;\n    background: #3d92e8;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 34px 45px 26px 45px;\n  }\n  .citation {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    padding: 0 90px;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-text\">\n      <h1>Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants and clinical outcomes</h1>\n      <p class=\"authors\">\n        Safinaz Adel Elhabashya, Eman M Mounir Sherifa, Nouran Yousef Salaha,<br>\n        Mostafa Ahmed Elsayed Abd Elkaderb, Dina Ahmed Hosney Youssefa\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"affil\">Pediatrics Department, Faculty of Medicine, Ain Shams University, Cairo, Egypt</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-img\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder hands-ph\">[Illustration: hands holding a stethoscope, top-right of header]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule-thick\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Three-column body -->\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <h2 class=\"section\">Introduction</h2>\n      <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n      <p class=\"body\">Adolescents are exposed to multiple developmental, cognitive and emotional challenges, including independence and autonomy acquisition, identity and self esteem development, and social bond creation.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">Aim</h2>\n      <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n      <p class=\"body\">To assess the risk determinants and clinical outcomes of uncontrolled diabetes among Egyptian adolescents with T1D.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">Methodology</h2>\n      <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n      <p class=\"step-text\">Six hundred adolescents with T1D were recruited from the Pediatric and Adolescents Diabetology Clinic, Ain-Shams University.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n      <p class=\"step-text\">From the studied cohort, 200 with good glycemic control (&le;7%) and 200 with poor control (&gt;7%) were assessed for diabetes-duration, insulin regimen, frequency of diabetic-ketoacidosis, clinically significant hypoglycemia and the Mini-International Neuropsychiatric-Interview for Children and Adolescents.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n      <p class=\"step-text\">Auxological assessment, fundus and clinical screening for complications were done.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"step-num\">4</div>\n      <p class=\"step-text\">Neuropathy was confirmed by nerve conduction velocity.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"step-num\">5</div>\n      <p class=\"step-text\">Thyroid profile, anti-tissue transglutaminase-IgG, fasting lipids and urinary albumin/excretion ratio (UAE) were measured.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid\">\n      <h2 class=\"section\">Results</h2>\n      <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n      <p class=\"body\">Adolescents having uncontrolled diabetes have significantly higher diabetes onset age (p = 0.037), diabetes-duration (p = 0.038), eating disorders (p = 0.027), sadness (p = 0.038), depression (p = 0.003), suicidal manifestations (p = 0.001) and anxiety (p&lt;0.001) than the well-controlled group.</p>\n\n      <table class=\"results\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Variables</td>\n            <td>Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 400)</td>\n            <td>Well controlled Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</td>\n            <td>Well controlled Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</td>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Empty Cell</td><td>r</td><td>p-value</td><td>r</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Age (years)</td><td>&minus;0.054</td><td>0.282</td><td>0.000</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Age at diabetes onset (y)</td><td>0.122*</td><td>0.014</td><td>&minus;0.011</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Diabetes duration (y)</td><td>0.103*</td><td>0.039</td><td>0.098</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Insulin dosage (U/kg/day)</td><td>&minus;0.051</td><td>0.312</td><td>0.082</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Parent social standard</td><td>&minus;0.021</td><td>0.671</td><td>&minus;0.121</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Weight z-score</td><td>&minus;0.043</td><td>0.391</td><td>&minus;0.025</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Height z-score</td><td>&minus;0.081</td><td>0.106</td><td>0.065</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>BMI z-score</td><td>0.040</td><td>0.425</td><td>&minus;0.067</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo-ph\">[Photo: clinician in white coat holding a stethoscope, bottom of middle column]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <p class=\"chart-title\">Generalized anxiety</p>\n      <div class=\"placeholder donut-ph\">[Chart: donut, top-right]</div>\n      <div class=\"legend\">\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s1\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Adolescents with T1D</span><span class=\"val\">20%</span></div>\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s2\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Well controlled Adolescents</span><span class=\"val\">20%</span></div>\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s3\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Poorly controlled Adolescents</span><span class=\"val\">60%</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"chart-title\">Frequency of DKA /yeared anxiety</p>\n      <div class=\"placeholder donut-ph\">[Chart: donut, right column]</div>\n      <div class=\"legend\">\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s1\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Adolescents with T1D</span><span class=\"val\">20%</span></div>\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s2\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Well controlled Adolescents</span><span class=\"val\">20%</span></div>\n        <div><span class=\"swatch s3\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Poorly controlled Adolescents</span><span class=\"val\">60%</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section small\">Conclusion</h2>\n      <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n      <p class=\"body\">Uncontrolled T1D among adolescents is associated with older age and psychiatric comorbidities. Furthermore, it is linked to school absenteeism, hyperlipidemia, diabetic nephropathy and neuropathy.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder syringe-ph\">[Photo: gloved hand holding a syringe, bottom-right]</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule-bottom\"></div>\n  <p class=\"citation\">Elhabashy, S.A., Sherif, E.M.M., Salah, N.Y., Abd Elkader, M.A.E. and Youssef, D.A.H., 2022. Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants and clinical outcomes. Diabetes Epidemiology and Management, 6, p.100051.</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
